      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Old Crackjaw damaged a creature with a jaws Strike in its previous action</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Old Crackjaw clenches its jaws down and automatically deals an additional 2d8 Bludgeoning Damage damage to the creature it just bit.</p>",
